I would recommend the following sequence:

1) get the following into open inventory
   - 1x b?scare monster
   - 1x b!full healing
2) wish for a cockatrice corpse
3) level teleport to the level they're on
4) drop the scroll
5) quaff the potion (if ILL)
6) get unstunned (if necessary)
7) wield the cockatrice corpse
8) make statues

A couple of notes:
- relying on Elbereth isn't safe.  If you're stunned,
  you probably won't write it correctly.
- levelteleport, don't take the stairs.  The scroll might
  fall down the stairs.  If you've already burned Elbereth
  on the downstair, then going up them is safe.

